  "instructions": [
    "In a small saucepan, melt 2 tablespoons of butter over medium heat.",
    "Add the flour and whisk to form a smooth paste.",
    "Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the Nutella, kimchi, cinnamon, and cardamom.",
    "Whisk until smooth and the Nutella is melted.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Remove from heat and stir in the honey until well combined.",
    "Serve warm, topped with additional kimchi if desired."
